{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17155","headline":"南至日隔仗望含元殿香鑪 · 车?","name":"南至日隔仗望含元殿香鑪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抗殿疏元首，高高接上元。\n节当南至日，星是北辰天。\n宝戟罗仙仗，金鑪引瑞烟。\n霏微双阙丽，溶曳九州连。\n拂曙祥光满，分晴晓色鲜。\n一阳今在历，生植愿陶甄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"车?","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}